; the raised central Wandelhalle with its 32 round skylights in two rows; the entrance under a stone colonnade toward the Piazzetta on the north; and, new, the shared Kulturforum entrance hall to the north-east as a low glazed hall with the Piazzetta's slope rising toward it. Guessed: the outline, heights (about 15 m, the hall 19 m), the lantern grid (the real rooms vary), the portico and the entrance hall's size and place."}